00:00:00,010 --> 00:00:00,720
[ Watch on kissFlix.co ]

1
00:00:00,740 --> 00:00:02,920
Stop making fun of it.

2
00:00:02,920 --> 00:00:05,430
Seriously, stop!

3
00:00:06,226 --> 00:00:09,455
I'll do my best, so...

4
00:00:09,455 --> 00:00:13,330
could you give me one more chance?

5
00:00:14,375 --> 00:00:16,208
Finally...

6
00:00:16,894 --> 00:00:19,176
Sui.

7
00:00:19,176 --> 00:00:20,816
You're so cute.

8
00:00:48,009 --> 00:00:50,367
- Let's eat.
- Let's eat.

9
00:00:52,666 --> 00:00:53,717
That's good.

10
00:00:53,717 --> 00:00:55,375
It's delicious.

11
00:00:55,375 --> 00:00:57,208
Let me feed you.

12
00:00:58,020 --> 00:00:59,344
Here.

13
00:01:03,858 --> 00:01:07,282
It's so hot. So hot.

14
00:01:09,840 --> 00:01:11,134
Is it really working?

15
00:01:11,134 --> 00:01:12,919
Yeah.

16
00:01:12,919 --> 00:01:14,731
Just a little more.

17
00:01:14,731 --> 00:01:17,969
Stop that. Hey, hold still.

18
00:01:20,257 --> 00:01:24,393
- Merry Christmas.
- Merry Christmas.

19
00:01:24,393 --> 00:01:26,528
All right.

20
00:01:27,194 --> 00:01:30,196
Wow, I'm so happy.

21
00:01:30,196 --> 00:01:33,034
Cute! How does it look?

22
00:01:33,798 --> 00:01:35,681
It looks cute.

23
00:01:35,681 --> 00:01:37,775
Look at this.

24
00:01:37,775 --> 00:01:39,458
It looks cool.

25
00:02:30,571 --> 00:02:32,093
Morning.

26
00:02:33,945 --> 00:02:37,307
Good... morning.

27
00:02:46,989 --> 00:02:48,454
Want to take a quick break?

28
00:02:48,454 --> 00:02:49,862
Okay.

29
00:02:54,690 --> 00:02:56,201
Here.

30
00:02:57,383 --> 00:02:59,245
Thank you.

31
00:03:00,873 --> 00:03:03,124
You work so hard every day.

32
00:03:06,127 --> 00:03:11,981
I begged my parents to let me do what I love.

33
00:03:11,981 --> 00:03:15,500
So I want to make sure I get results.

34
00:03:16,570 --> 00:03:20,677
Actually, I have a favor to ask.

35
00:03:20,677 --> 00:03:21,977
Huh?

36
00:03:21,977 --> 00:03:25,345
There's a practice game coming up.

37
00:03:25,345 --> 00:03:29,097
And I really need to win.

38
00:03:30,145 --> 00:03:34,280
If I win, let's go on a date.

39
00:03:36,914 --> 00:03:39,965
I'd go even if you didn't win, you know.

40
00:03:39,965 --> 00:03:41,747
I don't want that.

41
00:03:43,756 --> 00:03:48,491
- Huh?
- I want us to go after I actually win.

42
00:03:49,942 --> 00:03:53,348
Having a goal like that
makes me work harder.

43
00:03:57,350 --> 00:03:59,057
Got it.

44
00:03:59,057 --> 00:04:01,989
Then, if you win, we'll go on a date.

45
00:04:01,989 --> 00:04:03,484
Okay.

46
00:04:03,484 --> 00:04:04,944
You better win.

47
00:04:04,944 --> 00:04:06,938
I promise I will.

48
00:04:08,640 --> 00:04:10,440
All right.

49
00:04:12,394 --> 00:04:14,194
Thank you.

50
00:04:18,216 --> 00:04:21,119
Apparently they put up the room changes.

51
00:04:22,836 --> 00:04:25,624
Is that the room change stuff you mentioned?

52
00:04:25,624 --> 00:04:30,535
Yeah. It happens yearly, but don't worry.
It's only some people.

53
00:04:30,535 --> 00:04:33,632
Last year, nobody even ended up switching.

54
00:04:49,097 --> 00:04:51,934
Moving is such a pain.

55
00:04:51,934 --> 00:04:54,222
[Room Change Notice]

56
00:04:56,355 --> 00:04:57,732
What?

57
00:04:57,732 --> 00:05:00,657
[Room 208: Sui Kishida
Room 103: Harutora Kurobe]

58
00:06:05,073 --> 00:06:07,075
Thank you for everything.

59
00:06:11,469 --> 00:06:16,301
If you ever need anything,
just tell me, anytime.

60
00:06:20,498 --> 00:06:23,224
I'll carry these over now.

61
00:06:56,343 --> 00:06:58,018
I can't do this!

62
00:06:58,018 --> 00:07:02,857
No way, no way, no way!

63
00:07:02,857 --> 00:07:07,176
I can't be in a different room from Harutora!

64
00:07:07,176 --> 00:07:08,376
Whoa, whoa, whoa.

65
00:07:08,376 --> 00:07:10,497
What are you doing?

66
00:07:12,301 --> 00:07:13,784
Sorry.

67
00:07:13,784 --> 00:07:19,151
You were acting like my little brother,
so I couldn't help it.

68
00:07:19,151 --> 00:07:20,882
Little brother?

69
00:07:28,251 --> 00:07:30,750
So cute!

70
00:07:32,486 --> 00:07:34,059
Wait, hold on.

71
00:07:34,059 --> 00:07:36,346
How many of you are there?

72
00:07:36,346 --> 00:07:38,249
Ten.

73
00:07:38,249 --> 00:07:39,668
Really?

74
00:07:40,999 --> 00:07:42,987
Must be nice.

75
00:07:44,630 --> 00:07:47,436
It's great when they're cute, but...

76
00:07:47,436 --> 00:07:51,235
They fight and snatch things
from each other every day.

77
00:07:51,235 --> 00:07:53,790
I can't even study at home.

78
00:07:55,073 --> 00:07:57,210
That sounds rough.

79
00:08:04,350 --> 00:08:07,554
We're almost done,
so let's just get through this.

80
00:08:19,799 --> 00:08:24,404
You can take the extra detergent
if you want, Harutora.

81
00:08:39,979 --> 00:08:41,439
Okay.

82
00:08:58,429 --> 00:09:03,068
If you're missing anything,
feel free to come grab it.

83
00:09:05,776 --> 00:09:09,141
I mean, we're in the same dorm anyway.

84
00:09:10,447 --> 00:09:14,896
We can see each other whenever we want.

85
00:09:23,227 --> 00:09:24,964
Harutora?

86
00:10:00,619 --> 00:10:02,794
<i>Sorry, Harutora.</i>

87
00:10:07,674 --> 00:10:09,724
Today's game...

88
00:10:10,750 --> 00:10:13,010
I'm sorry I can't make it.

89
00:10:13,010 --> 00:10:15,598
It's okay, don't worry about it.

90
00:10:16,632 --> 00:10:20,225
- Harutora!
- Go for it!

91
00:10:27,428 --> 00:10:30,697
Go, Harutora!

92
00:11:52,347 --> 00:11:55,239
I brought him here. Come on.

93
00:11:57,026 --> 00:11:58,375
Cute, right?

94
00:11:58,375 --> 00:11:59,848
Huh? Jeez.

95
00:11:59,848 --> 00:12:01,704
Nice to meet you.

96
00:12:02,329 --> 00:12:04,816
Likewise.

97
00:12:04,816 --> 00:12:08,919
Okay, let me explain
how to use the shared kitchen.

98
00:12:08,919 --> 00:12:10,994
Wash your dishes and put them back.

99
00:12:10,994 --> 00:12:13,775
Label your things in the fridge.

100
00:12:13,775 --> 00:12:15,016
- Got it.
- Also...

101
00:12:15,016 --> 00:12:18,970
some of the seasonings are shared,
and some aren't.

102
00:12:18,970 --> 00:12:21,224
And one more thing...

103
00:12:21,995 --> 00:12:24,128
Kishida?

104
00:12:24,128 --> 00:12:27,545
- Yeah?
- Where do I put the washed dishes?

105
00:12:27,545 --> 00:12:31,181
This one's shared, so put it here.

106
00:12:31,181 --> 00:12:32,568
Got it.

107
00:12:55,132 --> 00:12:59,429
So, you like this stuff, Sui?

108
00:13:01,456 --> 00:13:05,763
Well, like I said earlier in the day,

109
00:13:05,763 --> 00:13:11,492
some of the things in the fridge
and the seasonings belong to other people,

110
00:13:11,492 --> 00:13:15,624
so just ask if you're not sure.

111
00:13:15,624 --> 00:13:17,364
Sorry.

112
00:13:17,364 --> 00:13:19,298
Hey.

113
00:13:19,298 --> 00:13:23,301
Is it true you can put honey on your skin?

114
00:13:23,301 --> 00:13:25,627
I do it sometimes too.

115
00:13:25,627 --> 00:13:28,793
Really? Come on, show me.

116
00:13:28,793 --> 00:13:31,536
What? Right now?

117
00:13:31,536 --> 00:13:33,033
Yeah.

118
00:13:36,880 --> 00:13:39,884
It's all sticky. Let's go wash it off.

119
00:13:39,884 --> 00:13:43,189
- Okay.
- I'm gonna take a shower.

120
00:13:43,189 --> 00:13:45,575
- All right.
- See you.

121
00:13:45,575 --> 00:13:48,269
- Bye.
- See you.

122
00:13:59,337 --> 00:14:00,907
Okay, then...

123
00:14:22,339 --> 00:14:24,132
What?

124
00:14:24,132 --> 00:14:28,580
Well, is Kurobe around?

125
00:14:28,580 --> 00:14:30,542
Isn't he at practice?

126
00:14:30,542 --> 00:14:32,839
I see. Thanks.

127
00:14:53,668 --> 00:14:56,903
Excuse me, are you on the basketball team?

128
00:14:56,903 --> 00:14:58,385
Hi.

129
00:14:58,385 --> 00:14:59,591
Did you just finish?

130
00:14:59,591 --> 00:15:02,468
No, it ended a while ago.

131
00:15:03,626 --> 00:15:05,958
Is Kurobe still around?

132
00:15:05,958 --> 00:15:07,867
You mean Harutora?

133
00:15:07,867 --> 00:15:10,232
He hasn't come back to his room.

134
00:15:10,232 --> 00:15:14,407
He's been practicing a lot lately.

135
00:15:14,407 --> 00:15:17,794
He seems really focused
on winning the next game.

136
00:15:17,794 --> 00:15:18,917
I see.

137
00:15:18,917 --> 00:15:23,033
Apparently, he has to win no matter what.

138
00:15:23,033 --> 00:15:24,782
No matter what?

139
00:15:27,645 --> 00:15:31,471
If I win, let's go on a date.

140
00:15:31,471 --> 00:15:32,822
You better win.

141
00:15:32,822 --> 00:15:34,876
I promise I will.

142
00:15:38,746 --> 00:15:40,848
Is something wrong?

143
00:15:40,848 --> 00:15:43,134
No. Thank you.

144
00:15:51,344 --> 00:15:53,083
Harutora.

145
00:16:10,087 --> 00:16:12,318
There we go.

146
00:16:13,600 --> 00:16:16,460
It's kinda embarrassing.

147
00:16:16,460 --> 00:16:19,033
But I want to cheer him on.

148
00:16:20,112 --> 00:16:22,900
Well, whatever.

149
00:16:22,900 --> 00:16:25,316
Let's just go for it.

150
00:16:25,316 --> 00:16:30,306
Excuse me, do you have a moment?

151
00:16:32,064 --> 00:16:33,367
Huh?

152
00:16:39,575 --> 00:16:41,463
I've never done laundry before.

153
00:16:41,463 --> 00:16:45,756
First, separate whites from colors.

154
00:16:45,756 --> 00:16:46,782
Okay.

155
00:16:46,782 --> 00:16:49,703
Also check the pockets, and then...

156
00:16:49,703 --> 00:16:52,383
Oh yeah, the basketball team
has a game today.

157
00:16:52,383 --> 00:16:55,107
- I heard the opponent is pretty strong.
- Yeah.

158
00:16:55,107 --> 00:16:57,236
A powerhouse school.

159
00:16:57,236 --> 00:16:58,974
I wonder if they'll win.

160
00:16:58,974 --> 00:17:01,161
Come on, let's go!

161
00:17:03,489 --> 00:17:06,049
Hey, over here!

162
00:17:07,305 --> 00:17:09,587
You got this, Harutora!

163
00:17:09,587 --> 00:17:11,381
Yeah!

164
00:17:11,381 --> 00:17:13,474
Okay, that should do it.

165
00:17:13,474 --> 00:17:15,131
Then, just hang them later.

166
00:17:15,131 --> 00:17:16,664
Wait.

167
00:17:16,664 --> 00:17:18,359
Is there anything else?

168
00:17:18,359 --> 00:17:20,612
How do I hang them?

169
00:17:20,612 --> 00:17:24,529
Huh? You don't even know that, newbie?

170
00:17:24,529 --> 00:17:26,067
Well, it is what it is.

171
00:17:26,067 --> 00:17:28,894
Sui's your roommate, so ask him.

172
00:17:28,894 --> 00:17:30,950
You're used to it, right?

173
00:17:32,310 --> 00:17:34,454
Sorry! I can't today!

174
00:17:34,454 --> 00:17:36,447
Can you help him?

175
00:17:36,447 --> 00:17:38,021
I really can't today.

176
00:17:38,021 --> 00:17:40,360
Huh? Why not?

177
00:17:40,360 --> 00:17:41,907
Today is...

178
00:17:44,318 --> 00:17:46,885
Today is a really important game!

179
00:17:47,759 --> 00:17:49,331
Hey!

180
00:17:50,172 --> 00:17:52,279
A really important game?

181
00:17:52,279 --> 00:17:55,258
Isn't today just a practice game?

182
00:17:55,258 --> 00:17:58,603
[Kiriyama High School - Sofu High School]
Let's go! Let's go!

183
00:18:05,351 --> 00:18:07,153
Move back!

184
00:18:33,125 --> 00:18:34,956
Go for it!

185
00:18:56,454 --> 00:18:58,904
- All right!
- We did it!

186
00:18:58,904 --> 00:19:00,623
Nice shot!

187
00:19:13,233 --> 00:19:14,962
You won.

188
00:19:14,962 --> 00:19:16,347
Yes.

189
00:19:16,948 --> 00:19:19,308
So, a promise is a promise.

190
00:19:20,568 --> 00:19:22,561
Yes.

191
00:19:40,577 --> 00:19:42,705
Wh-What's wrong?

192
00:19:42,705 --> 00:19:45,293
I couldn't sleep at all.

193
00:20:14,044 --> 00:20:15,567
Sorry!

194
00:20:33,791 --> 00:20:35,774
Dang it!

195
00:20:44,004 --> 00:20:47,397
Did something good happen?

196
00:20:47,397 --> 00:20:52,318
Huh? No, not really.

197
00:21:15,979 --> 00:21:17,467
Dai.

198
00:21:18,819 --> 00:21:20,846
Going somewhere?

199
00:21:21,623 --> 00:21:23,974
Well, yeah, sort of.

200
00:21:26,326 --> 00:21:28,020
Where to?

201
00:21:30,332 --> 00:21:32,893
Just shopping in Shibuya and stuff.

202
00:21:32,893 --> 00:21:35,910
Really? I was actually thinking
of heading into the city too.

203
00:21:35,910 --> 00:21:37,888
- Let's go together.
- Huh?

204
00:21:38,709 --> 00:21:40,036
Huh?

205
00:21:41,559 --> 00:21:43,243
What is it?

206
00:21:44,545 --> 00:21:45,982
Well.

207
00:21:48,574 --> 00:21:51,277
I'm with someone else today.

208
00:21:52,897 --> 00:21:54,241
What?

209
00:21:55,194 --> 00:21:58,784
It's not a date, is it?

210
00:22:07,174 --> 00:22:09,395
It's a date.

211
00:22:18,770 --> 00:22:20,448
With whom?

212
00:22:23,109 --> 00:22:24,429
Huh?

213
00:23:30,520 --> 00:23:32,607
You didn't run away like that before.

214
00:23:32,607 --> 00:23:34,529
Why are you showing him your weak side?

215
00:23:34,529 --> 00:23:36,969
- Sui.
- Did you really get a boyfriend?

216
00:23:36,969 --> 00:23:39,624
- Huh?
- We're dating, right?

217
00:23:39,624 --> 00:23:41,145
What happened to you?

218
00:23:41,145 --> 00:23:43,076
You've been acting weird.

219
00:23:45,154 --> 00:23:46,740
It's me. Hikaru.

220
00:23:46,740 --> 00:23:49,604
Are you really just friends?

221
00:23:49,604 --> 00:23:52,425
We drifted apart so fast, Sui.

222
00:23:52,425 --> 00:23:54,807
I missed you so much.

223
00:23:54,807 --> 00:23:57,961
Even when we're apart,
my feelings are always right by your side.

224
00:23:57,961 --> 00:24:00,039
I'll cherish this forever.

